{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>To You</b> — the words of the prophet, for he recounts that it was a year of drought, and this is [the meaning of] אכלה נאות, like נות רועים (pastures of shepherds). And R. Moses the Priest said: the meaning is like על עצי השדה אשר שם צפרים יקננו (upon the trees of the field, where birds nest). And Yefet said: as though אכלה אש (fire consumed). And it would be correct, were it not that יבשו אפיקי מים (the streams of water have dried up)."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:26.747179685Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}